---
layout: layouts/base.njk
permalink: /blog/index.html
lang: en
title: Tool guides | SignalDig Growth Research
description: Practical how-to guides for SignalDig SEO, AI-search, and social tools—written for marketers and operators, each linking to a specific product page.
ogType: website
bodyClass: page-blog-index
hreflangEn: https://daily-growth-signals.github.io/seo-signal-skills/blog/
hreflangZh: https://daily-growth-signals.github.io/seo-signal-skills/blog/
hreflangDefault: https://daily-growth-signals.github.io/seo-signal-skills/blog/
---
{% set posts = collections.posts or [] %}
{% set postsEn = posts | postsByLang('en') %}
{% set postsZh = posts | postsByLang('zh') %}

<script id="blog-page-config" type="application/json">{"kind":"index","lang":"en","altEn":"","altZh":""}</script>

<script type="application/ld+json">
{
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@graph": [
    {
      "@type": "CollectionPage",
      "@id": {{ (site.baseUrl + "/blog/#collection") | dump | safe }},
      "url": {{ (site.baseUrl + "/blog/") | dump | safe }},
      "name": {{ title | dump | safe }},
      "description": {{ description | dump | safe }},
      "isPartOf": {
        "@type": "WebSite",
        "name": {{ site.name | dump | safe }},
        "url": {{ (site.baseUrl + "/") | dump | safe }}
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "BreadcrumbList",
      "itemListElement": [
        {
          "@type": "ListItem",
          "position": 1,
          "name": "Home",
          "item": {{ (site.baseUrl + "/") | dump | safe }}
        },
        {
          "@type": "ListItem",
          "position": 2,
          "name": "Blog",
          "item": {{ (site.baseUrl + "/blog/") | dump | safe }}
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
</script>

<main class="blog-main" id="top">
  <section class="blog-hero section">
    <div class="blog-inner blog-inner--wide">
      <p class="blog-kicker" data-i18n="index.kicker">Guides</p>
      <h1 data-i18n="index.title">Practical guides for SEO &amp; social research</h1>
      <p class="blog-lede" data-i18n="index.lede">
        Short, problem-first how-tos for marketers and operators using SignalDig tools—keyword checks, visibility, backlinks, and public social research.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  {% if posts.length == 0 %}
  <section class="section blog-empty" id="guides-en" aria-labelledby="empty-heading">
    <div class="blog-inner blog-inner--wide">
      <div class="blog-empty-card">
        <h2 id="empty-heading" data-i18n="index.empty.title">Guides are on the way</h2>
        <p class="section-lede" data-i18n="index.empty.body">
          We are publishing practical how-tos for SignalDig SEO, AI-search, and social tools. Check back soon, or install the Growth Research Skill to start researching today.
        </p>
        <div class="actions">
          <a class="button button-dark" href="{{ '/#user-type' | url }}" data-i18n="index.empty.cta">Install the Skill</a>
          <a class="button button-light" href="{{ site.officialSite }}">signaldig.com</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <div id="guides-zh" class="blog-lang-anchor" hidden aria-hidden="true"></div>
  {% else %}
  <section class="section blog-category" id="guides-en" data-blog-lang="en" aria-labelledby="heading-en">
    <div class="blog-inner blog-inner--wide">
      <div class="blog-category-head">
        <h2 id="heading-en" data-i18n="index.enHeading">English guides</h2>
      </div>
      {% if postsEn.length == 0 %}
      <div class="blog-empty-card">
        <h2 data-i18n="index.enEmptyTitle">No English guides yet</h2>
        <p class="section-lede" data-i18n="index.enEmpty">No English guides yet—new ones land here first.</p>
      </div>
      {% else %}
      <ul class="blog-card-grid">
        {% for post in postsEn %}
        {% set tool = tools | toolById(post.data.toolId) %}
        <li>
          <a class="blog-card" href="{{ post.url | url }}">
            {% if tool %}
            <span class="blog-card-tag">{{ tool.name.en }}</span>
            {% endif %}
            <strong class="blog-card-title">{{ post.data.title }}</strong>
            <span class="blog-card-desc">{{ post.data.description }}</span>
            <span class="blog-card-meta">
              <time datetime="{{ post.data.date | isoDate }}">{{ post.data.date | isoDate }}</time>
              <span>EN</span>
            </span>
          </a>
        </li>
        {% endfor %}
      </ul>
      {% endif %}
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section blog-category" id="guides-zh" data-blog-lang="zh" aria-labelledby="heading-zh" hidden>
    <div class="blog-inner blog-inner--wide">
      <div class="blog-category-head">
        <h2 id="heading-zh" data-i18n="index.zhHeading">中文指南</h2>
      </div>
      {% if postsZh.length == 0 %}
      <div class="blog-empty-card">
        <h2 data-i18n="index.zhEmptyTitle">暂无中文指南</h2>
        <p class="section-lede" data-i18n="index.zhEmpty">暂无中文指南，稍后会在这里更新。</p>
      </div>
      {% else %}
      <ul class="blog-card-grid">
        {% for post in postsZh %}
        {% set tool = tools | toolById(post.data.toolId) %}
        <li>
          <a class="blog-card" href="{{ post.url | url }}">
            {% if tool %}
            <span class="blog-card-tag">{{ tool.name.zh }}</span>
            {% endif %}
            <strong class="blog-card-title">{{ post.data.title }}</strong>
            <span class="blog-card-desc">{{ post.data.description }}</span>
            <span class="blog-card-meta">
              <time datetime="{{ post.data.date | isoDate }}">{{ post.data.date | isoDate }}</time>
              <span>中文</span>
            </span>
          </a>
        </li>
        {% endfor %}
      </ul>
      {% endif %}
    </div>
  </section>
  {% endif %}
</main>
